    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Tauren racial traits.</p><ul><li>+2 Strength, -2 Agility; Medium; land speed 30 feet.</li><li>Horns are a proficient natural weapon dealing 1d8 plus Strength modifier.</li><li>Treat tauren halberds and totems as martial weapons; proficient with longspears and shortspears.</li><li>+2 Handle Animal and Survival, which are always class skills.</li><li>Automatic Common and Taur-ahe; bonus Goblin, Low Common, and Orcish.</li><li>Favored class Warrior; eligible for up to three tauren racial levels.</li></ul>"
    },
